{"id":"909c5efc04dca7f4","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-foundation.md","title":"Foundation","display":"thm-foundation — Foundation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-foundation","aliases":["58-thm-foundation"],"display":"thm-foundation — Foundation","depends_on":["[[58-df-well-founded]]","[[58-df-hierarchy]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-foundation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-foundation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-foundation — Foundation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"58-df-well-founded\">58-df-well-founded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"58-df-hierarchy\">58-df-hierarchy</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All object-language variables range over sets</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}foundation} \\vdash \\forall x\\;\\bigl(x\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\exists y\\in x\\;(x\\cap y=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}foundation} \\vdash \\forall x\\;\\bigl(x\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\exists y\\in x\\;(x\\cap y=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Foundation (regularity) says every nonempty set has an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>-minimal element.</li>\n<li>In ZF, it rules out any set-coded infinite descending <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>-sequence; this formulation does not quantify over a hypothetical proper-class sequence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hierarchy]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}foundation} \\vdash \\forall x\\;\\bigl(x\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\exists y\\in x\\;(x\\cap y=\\emptyset)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\in","display":false}],"bytes":723,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4164","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-foundation.md|58-thm-foundation]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["9e70b896da231f4f","19e9a8c33d5c841c"]}